{'symbol': 'GM', 'date': '2021-11-16 06:00:00', 'title': 'EV CONNECT OFFERS GM DEALERSHIPS CHARGING MANAGEMENT AND NETWORK SERVICES ACROSS CANADA & U.S.', 'text': "EL SEGUNDO, CALIF., NOV. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PREMIER ELECTRIC VEHICLE (EV) CHARGING SOLUTION PROVIDER EV CONNECT \xa0ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY IS ONE OF THE APPROVED EV CHARGING SOLUTIONS PROVIDERS TO SUPPORT THE DEPLOYMENT OF CHARGING AT GENERAL MOTORS' DEALERSHIPS (NYSE: GM) ACROSS THE U.S AND CANADA."}